    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d809">

                <pb facs="0899" n="889" xml:id="pg889"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.93/11–1548: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-11-16T18:00:00-05:00">November 16, 1948—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1634. No personnel should be evacuated US. Dept plans transfer large number to
                    other posts Far East[;] telegraph names personnel you intend evacuate from
                    Nanking Shanghai and other Chinese posts. Ref para 4 urtel 2216 Nov 15,
                        1948.<anchor n="62" xml:id="d809-f1"/> Paragraphs 1, 2 and 3 being answered
                    separately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
